  "solution": "BODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\nGiven: if ‘ **× = −, ****− = +, ****+ = ÷, ****÷ = ×** are interchanged, then:\n\nNow, checking the options:\n\n**Option 1) 10 + 2 - 5 × 2 = 8**\n\n**⇒ 10 ÷ 2 + 5 − 2 = ?**\n\n**⇒ 5 + 5 − 2 = ?**\n\n**⇒ 10 − 2 ****=** **8**\n\nOption 2) 15 - 5 + 5 × 2 = 18\n\n⇒ 15 + 5 ÷ 5 − 2 = ?\n\n⇒ 15 + 1 − 2 = ?\n\n⇒ 16 − 2 = 14 ≠ 18\n\nOption 3) 12 / 2 + 3 - 1 = 10\n\n⇒ 12 × 2 ÷ 3 + 1 = ?\n\n⇒ 24 ÷ 3 + 1​ = ?\n\n⇒ 8 + 1​ = 7 ≠ 10\n\nOption 4) 20 + 4 - 2 × 1 = 5\n\n⇒ 20 ÷ 4 + 2 − 1 = ?\n\n⇒ 5+ 2 − 1 = ?\n\n⇒ 7 − 1 = 6 ≠ 5.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".\n\ncb",
